issibleOrdinal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> is the metatheoretic compatibility predicate defined here</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}alias}\n\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4AdmissibleOrdinal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\alpha)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}alias}\n\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4AdmissibleOrdinal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\alpha)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical atom supplies only metalinguistic KP satisfaction, not a set predicate.  This alias therefore preserves that object/meta boundary instead of inventing an unsupported suffix <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_S\">\\(_S\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1e68a0f54b805bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1e68a0f54b805bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"m